So you can imagine, right? So this may become an impossible problem to solve.

1873
02:36:49,536 --> 02:36:57,776
那么，如果给定的句子在过去的任何数据中都没有出现过，无论是书籍还是任何公开可用的材料呢？
So what if the given sentence doesn't even come anywhere in the past data, be it books or any materials that is publicly available,

1874
02:36:58,446 --> 02:37:02,336
在这种情况下，我们根本无法预测后续的词，对吧？
There is no way we can predict the next words in that case, right?

1875
02:37:02,606 --> 02:37:05,156
