1909
02:41:04,304 --> 02:41:14,544
它是概率预测，对吧？这意味着大语言模型会选择在那个序列中作为下一个词、且具有最大概率的词。
It is probabilistic prediction, right? That means the LLM chooses the token that has the maximum probability of being the next token in that sequence,

1910
02:41:14,798 --> 02:41:15,104
对吧？
right?

1911
02:41:15,438 --> 02:41:19,588
