驴、狗，对吧？我们有一堆候选词，而“狗”的最高概率是 97.98%。所以这个词会被视为下一个词。
do, dogs, right? So we have a bunch of words, and dog has the highest probability that is 97.98%. So this word will be considered as the next word.

