React Framework. So synergizing reasoning and acting in language models.

2530
03:37:32,144 --> 03:37:32,464
对。
Right.

2531
03:37:32,590 --> 03:37:35,620
请大家在有空的时候读一下这篇文章。
So please go through this article right when you have some time.

2532
03:37:36,014 --> 03:37:38,544
我也会把这篇论文放在资源栏里提供给大家。
I will provide this in the resource section as well.

2533
03:37:38,624 --> 03:37:44,292
这样你们就可以去阅读这篇文章，对 ReAct 框架有个大概的了解。
So you can go through this article and get an idea on the React framework.

2534
03:37:44,704 --> 03:37:51,332
基本上 RE 代表推理，ACT 代表行动。
So essentially RE stands for reasoning and ACT stands for action.

2535
03:37:51,662 --> 03:37:53,604
好的，就是推理和行动。
Okay, so reasoning and action.

2536
03:37:53,934 --> 03:38:03,424
通过使用这个 ReAct 框架，智能体将能够与外部世界互动，并帮助智能体进行规划和推理。
So by using this React framework, agents will be able to interact with the external world and help agents to plan and reason as well.

2537
03:38:03,598 --> 03:38:03,904
好的。
Okay.

2538
03:38:04,398 --> 03:38:07,824
那么现在我们来看看 ReAct 是如何诞生的。
So now let's see how React was born first.

2539
03:38:08,224 --> 03:38:14,274
我们最初是从思维链提示开始的。这是提示工程的一种技术。
So we initially started with chain of thought prompting. So this is one of the prompt engineering technique.

2540
03:38:14,638 --> 03:38:24,799
思维链，也就是 COT 提示技术，能让大语言模型像人类一样思考和规划一样来回答问题。
Chain of thought that is COT prompting technique helps LLMs to answer as if they are thinking and planning, similar to how a human does.

2541
03:38:24,799 --> 03:38:32,914
对，比如我们在这里提出了两个问题：标准提示与思维链提示的对比，所以
right for example we have asked two questions here standard prompting versus chain of thought prompting right so

2542
03:38:32,914 --> 03:38:41,744
你可以看到这里的题目：罗杰有五个网球，他又买了两罐网球。每罐
you can see the question here Roger has five tennis balls he buys two more cans of tennis balls Each can

2543
03:38:42,064 --> 03:38:43,744
有三个网球。
has three tennis balls.

2544
03:38:43,984 --> 03:38:46,304
他现在有多少个网球？
How many tennis balls does he have now?

2545
03:38:46,464 --> 03:38:46,624
好的。
Okay.

2546
03:38:47,086 --> 03:38:48,624
答案是 11 个。
So the answer is 11.

2547
03:38:49,184 --> 03:38:52,324
因为是 5 加 2 乘以 3。
Because five plus two times three.

2548
03:38:52,750 --> 03:38:54,116
所以总共是 11。
So total is 11.

2549
03:38:54,510 --> 03:38:56,900
所以在这种情况下，LLM 回答正确了。
So in this case the LLM answered correctly.

2550
03:38:57,104 --> 03:39:07,972
然后如果你看第二个问题：食堂有 23 个苹果。如果他们用掉 20 个做午餐并又买了 6 个，他们现在有多少个苹果？
And then if you see the second question, the cafeteria had 23 apples. If they use 20 to make lunch and bought six more, how many apples do they have?

2551
03:39:08,224 --> 03:39:13,104
所以使用标准提示词时，大语言模型给出的输出是 27。
So with standard prompting, the LLM gave the output as 27.

2552
03:39:13,454 --> 03:39:13,664
好的。
Okay.

2553
03:39:13,934 --> 03:39:22,692
这个结果是不正确的，对吧？因为总共有 23 个苹果，他们用了 20 个。所以是 23 减去 20，然后再买了 6 个。
So which is not correct, right? Because total 23 apples, they use 20. So 23 minus 20, and then they bought 6 more again.

2554
03:39:22,990 --> 03:39:27,108
也就是加上 6，23 减 20 加 6，结果应该是 9，对吧？
So plus 6, 23 minus 20 plus 6, which is 9, right?

2555
03:39:27,534 --> 03:39:29,904
但大语言模型给出的答案是 27。
But the LLM gave the answer as 27.

2556
03:39:30,064 --> 03:39:35,104
好的。所以在大模型使用标准提示词时，给出了错误的答案。
Okay. So the LLM gave the wrong answer with the standard prompting.

2557
03:39:35,264 --> 03:39:38,532
这就是为什么他们引入了思维链（CoT）提示词。
So that's why they introduced chain of thought prompting.

2558
03:39:38,864 --> 03:39:50,304
如果你看这里的思维链提示词，这还是同一个问题。你可以看到答案：Rajat 最初有 5 个球，2 个装有 3 个网球的罐子，每个罐子里都是 6 个网球。
So if you see the chain of thought prompting here, this is again the same question. So you can see the answer. Rajat started with 5 balls, 2 cans of 3 tennis balls, each is 6 tennis balls.

2559
03:39:50,446 --> 03:39:52,228
所以 5 加 6 等于 11。
So 5 plus 6 is equal to 11.

2560
03:39:52,398 --> 03:40:01,024
你可以看到详细的解答过程，对吧？然后对于同一个问题，这里它试图给出的答案是：咖啡馆最初有 23 个苹果。
So you can see the detailed answer, right? And then with the same question, here it is trying to give the cafeteria had 23 apples originally.

2561
03:40:01,422 --> 03:40:10,608
他们用 20 个做午餐。所以他们剩下 23 减 20 等于 3 个，然后又买了 6 个苹果。所以他们现在有 3 加 6，也就是 9 个。
They use 20 to make lunch. So they had 23 minus 20, which is 3, and they bought 6 more apples. So they have 3 plus 6, 9.

2562
03:40:10,768 --> 03:40:11,748
答案是 9。
The answer is 9.

2563
03:40:12,014 --> 03:40:20,688
所以你可以看到在提示词本身中，我们就在告诉大语言模型推理是如何进行的。然后大语言模型会在它预测的回答中模仿这种模式。
So you can see in the prompt itself we are telling the LLM how reasoning is done. Then the LLM will mimic that in the response it predicts.

2564
03:40:20,878 --> 03:40:30,368
没错。所以你可以在 CoT 提示词中看到我们实际上展示了推理示例。这样大语言模型在回答时就能模仿同样的逻辑。
Right. So you can see in the C O T prompt we are actually showing the reasoning example. So the LLM can mimic the same when answering.

2565
03:40:30,542 --> 03:40:34,788
然后当我们提问时，它就能正确回答了。对吧。
And then when we asked a question, it is able to answer. Right.

2566
03:40:35,086 --> 03:40:42,528
所以你可以看到大语言模型提供了一个详细的答案，就像是在思考并回答一样，对吧？
So you can see the LLM provided the answer in a detailed way as if the LLM is thinking and answering, right?

2567
03:40:42,688 --> 03:40:52,196
这清楚地告诉我们，当我们把思考过程包含在提示词中时，大语言模型就会像在进行规划一样来回答。
So this clearly tells us that when we include thought process in the prompt itself, then the LLM will answer as if it is planning.

2568
03:40:52,448 --> 03:41:01,764
而这种思维链提示词技术证明了，大语言模型有能力生成推理轨迹或生成思考过程。
And this chain of thought prompting technique proved that the LLMs are capable of generating the reasoning traces or generating the thoughts.

2569
03:41:02,254 --> 03:41:06,500
没错。你可以看到它就像在思考后再回答一样。
Right. So you can see as if the LLM is trying to think and then answer.

2570
03:41:06,926 --> 03:41:08,836
你可以在这里的答案中看到这一点。
So you can see that in the answers here.

2571
03:41:09,262 --> 03:41:15,780
但思维链提示词的问题在于，它缺乏与外部世界的交互。
But the issue with chain of thought prompting is chain of thought prompting lacks access to the external world.

2572
03:41:16,048 --> 03:41:19,396
所以它无法采取行动，也就是说，它无法执行操作。
So it cannot act, that is, it cannot take the action.

2573
03:41:19,888 --> 03:41:27,940
推理部分很好，对吧？大语言模型能够进行推理，但除了推理之外，我们也希望大语言模型能采取行动，对吧？
Reasoning part is good, right? So the LLM is able to reason, but we also want LLM to take the action, right? In addition to reasoning.

2574
03:41:28,430 --> 03:41:33,088
为了解决这个问题，我们有了 ReAct 框架。
So to address this issue, we have the React framework.

2575
03:41:33,326 --> 03:41:36,900
ReAct 框架是建立在思维链之上的。
So React framework was built on top of chain of thought.

2576
03:41:37,168 --> 03:41:46,608
好的。所以 ReAct 意味着大语言模型加上推理，也就是所谓的思维链。然后我们还加入了行动。
Okay. So React means LLM plus reasoning, which is nothing but chain of thought. And then we are also adding action.

2577
03:41:46,734 --> 03:41:50,052
这就是为什么它被称为 ReAct，即推理（Reasoning）和行动（Action）。
So that's why it is called React reasoning and action.

2578
03:41:50,368 --> 03:41:50,688
好的。
Okay.

2579
03:41:51,022 --> 03:41:57,924
而 ReAct 框架实现这一点的原理是：思考、行动、观察循环。
And the way the React framework does that is through a principle called thought, action, observation loop.

2580
03:41:58,528 --> 03:41:59,648
TAO。
TAO.

2581
03:42:00,368 --> 03:42:08,356
所以“思考”意味着智能体的 LLM 在思考下一步该做什么，对问题状态进行规划和分析。
So thought means the agent's LLM thinks about what to do next, planning and analyzing the problem state.

2582
03:42:08,526 --> 03:42:14,916
而“行动”意味着基于这种思考，智能体采取行动，比如调用一个工具。
And the action means based on the thought, the agent takes an action such as invoking a tool.

2583
03:42:15,182 --> 03:42:19,168
例如，DuckDuckGo 网络搜索工具或者 LLM 数学工具，对吧？
For example, DuckDuckGo web search tool or LLM math tool, right?

2584
03:42:19,328 --> 03:42:28,356
而“观察”意味着智能体接收到其行动的结果，这是融入到其推理中的新信息。
And the observation means the agent receives the result of its action, which is a new information to incorporate into its reasoning.

2585
03:42:28,688 --> 03:42:31,492
这就是思考、行动、观察循环。
So that is the thought, action, observation loop.

2586
03:42:31,968 --> 03:42:36,516
好，如果我们用之前看过的那个 iPhone 例子。
So if we take the same iPhone example that we have seen before.

2587
03:42:37,326 --> 03:42:42,020
这是我们的示例，对吧？我们通过使用 LangChain 构建了一个智能体应用。
So this is our example, right? So we built an agentic application by using Langchain.

2588
03:42:42,528 --> 03:42:48,420
假设我们给智能体提供同样的例子，它的“思考”将是
So let's say if we give the same example to an agent, the thought will be

2589
03:42:50,446 --> 03:42:51,780
它必须要做什么。
what it has to do.

2590
03:42:52,974 --> 03:42:58,180
最新的 iPhone 型号是什么？价格是多少美元？请把价格换算成英镑。
What is the latest iPhone model and its price in USD? Give me the price in UK currency.

2591
03:42:58,528 --> 03:43:03,168
那么它的思考将是：我需要查询 iPhone 的价格。
So the thought will be I have to check the iPhone price.

2592
03:43:03,328 --> 03:43:06,288
基于此，智能体将采取行动。
And based on that, the agent will take an action.

2593
03:43:06,448 --> 03:43:14,688
然后智能体思考：好的，让我进行网络搜索；接着智能体收到观察结果：价格似乎是美元。
Then the agent thinks, okay, let me do a web search, and then the agent receives an observation that the price seems to be in dollars.

2594
03:43:14,928 --> 03:43:19,396
另外请注意，智能体不会在第一个循环后就停止。
Also, please note that the agent will not stop after this first loop.

2595
03:43:19,662 --> 03:43:24,996
智能体会不断重复这个循环，直到它得到正确的答案。
And the agent keeps repeating this loop until the agent gets the correct answer.

2596
03:43:25,198 --> 03:43:25,408
好的。
Okay.

2597
03:43:25,774 --> 03:43:33,988
在第二个循环中，智能体的思考将是：价格需要从美元转换为英镑。
And in the second loop, the agent thought would be the price need to be converted from USD to UK currency.

2598
03:43:34,862 --> 03:43:36,388
这就是第二次思考。
That is the second thought.

2599
03:43:36,720 --> 03:43:42,788
然后行动就是：好的，为了进行价格转换，让我使用计算器工具。
And then the action would be okay, in order to do the price conversion, let me use a calculator tool.

2600
03:43:42,990 --> 03:43:52,400
观察结果就是英镑价格。对吧。一旦它获得英镑价格，智能体就会对这个答案感到满意。
And the observation would be price in UK currency. Right. So once it gets the price in UK currency, the agent will be satisfied with this answer.

2601
03:43:52,526 --> 03:43:56,960
这个循环会一直重复，直到智能体对答案满意为止。
And this loop repeats until the agent satisfies with the answer.

2602
03:43:57,166 --> 03:43:58,852
然后链就结束了，对吧？
Then finished chain, right?

2603
03:43:59,630 --> 03:44:02,948
这就是我们给出的输入，这也是我们得到的输出。
So this is the input we gave and this is the output we got.

2604
03:44:03,150 --> 03:44:08,800
如果你注意到这里，你就能理解语言模型和智能体之间的区别了，对吧？
So if you notice here, you understand the difference between a language model and an agent, right?

2605
03:44:09,006 --> 03:44:14,240
例如，语言模型（如 Chat GPT）生成答案后就会在那里停止。
The language model, for example, chat GPT generates an answer and stops over there.

2606
03:44:14,414 --> 03:44:19,520
而智能体会不断重复循环，直到它对答案满意为止。
Whereas an agent keeps repeating the loop until it satisfies with the answer.

2607
03:44:19,760 --> 03:44:23,364
这就是语言模型和智能体之间的区别。
So that is the difference between a language model and an agent.

2608
03:44:23,840 --> 03:44:24,160
好的。
Okay.

2609
03:44:24,560 --> 03:44:29,988
一旦智能体对答案满意，它就会停止执行。
So once the agent satisfies with the answer, then it will stop the execution.

2610
03:44:30,542 --> 03:44:42,308
如果你注意到在思维链提示中，并没有“思考、行动、观察”这样的循环，对吧？只有思考然后回答。它是先思考，然后给出答案。
So if you notice in chain of thought prompting, there is no loop as thought, action, observation, right? There is only thinking and then answering. It is thinking and then giving the answer.

2611
03:44:42,862 --> 03:44:50,320
而在 ReAct 框架中，循环正在发生，对吧？它既包含推理，也包含行动。
Whereas in the React framework, the loop is happening, right? That is both reasoning and as well as action.

2612
03:44:50,606 --> 03:44:55,120
所以这里的行动是通过我们提供的工具来执行的。
So here actions are performed by using the tools that we provide.

2613
03:44:55,360 --> 03:45:07,332
例如，使用 DuckDuckGo Search 工具进行网络搜索，或者使用 LLM 数学工具进行汇率转换，对吧？所以这些行动是依靠我们提供给 LLM 的工具来完成的。
For example, use the DuckDuckGo search tool and do the web search, or use the LLM math tool and do the rate conversion, right? So the action is happening by the tools that we provided to the LLM.

2614
03:45:07,680 --> 03:45:13,040
这就是为什么 ReAct 框架中同时包含行动和推理。
So that's why both action and reasoning is happening with React framework.

2615
03:45:13,294 --> 03:45:18,884
所以你可以看到，在 ReAct 框架中，智能体在不断地与外部世界交互，对吧？
So you can see in this React framework, an agent continuously interacts with the external world, right?

2616
03:45:19,182 --> 03:45:25,440
而且在观察环节，我们也可以引入人工参与，并给智能体提供反馈。
And in the observation, we can have humans in the loop as well, and we can provide the feedback to an agent.

2617
03:45:25,680 --> 03:45:26,000
好的。
Okay.

2618
03:45:26,640 --> 03:45:31,556
所以智能体就是配备了工具的 LLM。
So agents are LLMs equipped with tools.

2619
03:45:31,950 --> 03:45:39,440
通过使用 ReAct 框架，智能体与外部世界互动，从而为它们的推理增加额外信息。
And using this React framework, agents interact with the external world to add additional information into their reasoning.

2620
03:45:39,662 --> 03:45:43,600
所以现在你明白 LLM 和智能体的区别了，对吧？
So now you get the difference between LLM and agent, right?

2621
03:45:43,920 --> 03:45:50,240
你可以称之为 ReAct 框架、Agentic AI 或者智能体框架。
So you can call this React framework or agentic AI or agentic framework.

2622
03:45:50,414 --> 03:45:52,640
这就是这个框架背后的核心理念。
That's the idea behind this framework.

2623
03:45:52,800 --> 03:45:56,772
即同时包含推理和采取行动。
So both reasoning as well as taking the action.

2624
03:45:57,070 --> 03:45:57,360
好的。
Okay.

2625
03:45:57,774 --> 03:46:04,080
现在让我们看另一个例子，来更好地理解这个思考、行动、观察的概念。
Now let's see another example to understand this thought, action, observation concept much better.

2626
03:46:04,366 --> 03:46:15,972
假设有一个孩子去参加派对，这里有五个盒子，这个孩子必须找到装有玩具的那个盒子。
So assume that there is a kid who went to a party and assume there are five boxes here, and the kid has to find the box which has the toy.

2627
03:46:16,494 --> 03:46:16,800
好的。
Okay.

2628
03:46:17,280 --> 03:46:30,240
在这里你可以看到思考、行动、观察循环。例如，第一步是孩子走向第一个盒子，然后他观察到第一个盒子里没有玩具。
So here you can see the thought, action, observation loop. Right. For example, let's say the first thing is kid goes to the first box and then it observes there is no toy at the first box.

2629
03:46:30,400 --> 03:46:33,920
接着第三步就是：好的，第一个盒子里没东西。
And then the third would be okay, nothing in the box one.

2630
03:46:34,320 --> 03:46:38,000
那么行动就是去下一个盒子，也就是第二个盒子。
So the action is to go to the next box that is box two.

2631
03:46:38,320 --> 03:46:44,068
然后再次确认：好的，这里也没东西，于是孩子知道他需要去第三个盒子。
And then again, okay, there is nothing here, and then the kid knows it needs to go to the third box.

2632
03:46:44,480 --> 03:46:48,068
最终，这个孩子在第三个盒子里找到了玩具。
So the kid finds the toy eventually in box three.

2633
03:46:48,366 --> 03:46:53,412
就像我们人类做决策一样，智能体也在做同样的事情，对吧？
So just like how we human make decisions, agents are doing the same, right?

2634
03:46:53,600 --> 03:46:58,400
还有一个重要点是，智能体也需要具备记忆。
And also another important point is agents need to have memory as well.

2635
03:46:58,640 --> 03:47:08,452
例如，如果这个孩子忘记了他已经检查过第二个盒子，或者在到达第三个盒子时忘记了在第二个盒子里发生了什么，
For example, if this kid forgot that he already checked box 2 and forgot what happened at box 2 when he was at box 3,

2636
03:47:08,750 --> 03:47:10,596
那么他可能就需要折返去检查，对吧？
then he may need to go back, right?

2637
03:47:10,830 --> 03:47:15,440
这就是为什么记忆对于记住之前的行动非常重要。
So that's why memory is important to remember the previous actions.

2638
03:47:15,630 --> 03:47:19,440
也就是说，过去交互的记忆非常关键。
That is the memory of past interactions is very important.

2639
03:47:19,840 --> 03:47:32,000
同样地，回到我们 iPhone 的例子，如果智能体不记得 USD 的价格，那么它就无法计算转换成英国货币的价格。
Similarly, if we go back to our iPhone example, if the agent doesn't remember the price in USD, then the agent cannot calculate the price conversion to UK currency,

2640
03:47:32,160 --> 03:47:34,400
对吧？所以记忆非常重要。
right? So the memory is important.

2641
03:47:34,800 --> 03:47:42,372
所以现在我们了解到，智能体可以与外部世界交互，并且拥有记忆。
So now we understand that agents interact with the external world and also have memory.

