05:17:33,806 --> 05:17:37,540
也就是说，代码本身是由 LLM 生成的。
So the code itself will be generated by the LLM.

3549
05:17:37,632 --> 05:17:46,032
也就是说，每当 LLM 需要执行操作时，它会将该操作转换为代码，然后执行该操作。
That is, whenever the LLM need to perform an action, it will convert that action into code and then it will perform the action.

3550
05:17:46,592 --> 05:18:01,412
所以我们既有代码智能体，也有工具调用智能体。smolagents 的重要特性是让 AI 智能体通过编写代码来调用工具，而不仅仅是填写 JSON 架构。
So we have coding agent as well as tool calling agent. So the important feature of small agents is that it will let the AI agent call the tools by writing code, not just by filling out a JSON schema.

3551
05:18:01,646 --> 05:18:08,832
如果你看传统的智能体框架，它们通常倾向于让模型以 JSON 格式输出响应。
