4290
06:17:49,230 --> 06:17:52,644
我们获取原始查询，并将其转换为向量嵌入。
We take our original query and we convert it into vector embeddings.

4291
06:17:52,782 --> 06:17:57,348
此外，我们还会把额外的文档转换成向量嵌入。
Also, we take our additional documents and we convert them into vector embeddings.

4292
06:17:57,632 --> 06:17:59,952
然后我们就进行相似性搜索。
And then we are doing a similarity search.

4293
06:18:00,078 --> 06:18:09,156
也就是说，我们要从所有额外文档中找出与我们的提示词向量最匹配的，这将给我们提供一份相似文档列表。
That is, we are checking out of all the additional documents which are more aligned to our prompt vector, and that will give us the list of similar documents.

4294
06:18:09,392 --> 06:18:14,020
接着我们会结合查询内容，从而得到修改后的提示词。
And then we will augment with the query, which will give us the modified prompt.

4295
06:18:14,286 --> 06:18:18,948
这个修改后的提示词将传递给 LLM，从而让我们获得最准确的答案。
This modified prompt will be passed to the LLM and that will give us the most accurate answers.

4296
06:18:19,312 --> 06:18:24,548
而我们存储这些向量的地方被称为向量数据库。
And the place where we store these vectors is called vector database.

4297
06:18:24,782 --> 06:18:32,832
我们有几种技术可以帮助我们进行快速的向量相似性搜索，比如 FAISS、Pinecone、Chroma DB、Qdrant
We have several techniques that can help us do the vector similarity searches FA, I S S, Pinecone, Chroma DB, VAV8,

4298
06:18:33,072 --> 06:18:34,112
Milvus 等。
Milwaukee, etc.

4299
06:18:34,592 --> 06:18:37,152
所以我们理解了 RAG 的概念。
So we understood the concept of RAG.

4300
