第四步是创建向量索引。
Step 4 is create vector index.

4310
06:19:13,358 --> 06:19:23,072
我们有向量数据库来存储嵌入，而向量索引能帮助我们检索数据库并找出与提示词相似的向量。好的。
So we have the vector database to store the embeddings, and vector index will help us to go through the database and identify the vectors which are similar to our prompt. Okay.

4311
06:19:23,246 --> 06:19:25,632
第五步是创建一个查询引擎。
