5553
07:53:30,158 --> 07:53:40,772
我们需要注明任务，也就是我们创建并分配给那三个智能体的任务，以及工作流，即层级与串行的区别。
We need to mention the tasks that is the tasks we created to assign to agents, that is three agents we created, and workflow that is hierarchical versus sequential.

5554
07:53:41,678 --> 07:53:46,404
在构建项目之前，让我们先用 CrewAI 来了解这些工作流。
Let's understand workflows using crew AI before we build the project.

5555
07:53:47,118 --> 07:53:48,580
这些是五种工作流：
These are the five workflows

5556
07:53:49,294 --> 07:53:54,020
串行、层级、混合、并行和异步。
sequential, hierarchical, hybrid, parallel, and async.

5557
07:53:54,670 --> 07:54:01,860
串行流意味着第一个智能体完成任务后，将其交给第二个智能体，以此类推。
Sequential flow means the first agent completes its task and then it will hand it over to the second agent and so on.

5558
07:54:02,510 --> 07:54:04,292
下一个是层级流。
Next one is hierarchical flow.

5559
07:54:04,814 --> 07:54:07,780
其中会有一个管理智能体来管理其他智能体。
There will be a manager agent which will manage the agents.

5560
07:54:08,334 --> 07:54:14,532
任务由管理智能体接收，然后由它决定将任务分配给谁。
The task will be received by the manager agent, and the manager agent will decide whom to assign the task to.

5561
07:54:15,342 --> 07:54:19,108
所以这里没有顺序，不像串行智能体工作流那样。
So here there is no sequence unlike sequential agent workflow.

5562
07:54:19,406 --> 07:54:20,644
下一个是混合。
The next one is hybrid.

5563
07:54:21,198 --> 07:54:23,716
这是串行和层级的结合。
This is the combination of sequential and hierarchical.

5564
07:54:24,078 --> 07:54:25,860
另一个是并行。
The other one is parallel.

5565
07:54:26,446 --> 07:54:30,788
当我们需要多个智能体同时并行工作时，就会用到这个。
This is used when we want multiple agents working in parallel at the same time.

5566
07:54:31,406 --> 07:54:39,360
假设我们要筛选 5000 份文件，我们可以启动五个智能体，给每个智能体分配 1000 份文件。
Let's say we have to sift through some 5000 documents, then we can spin up five agents, assign 1000 documents to each.

5567
07:54:39,694 --> 07:54:42,148
工作完成后，我们可以合并输出结果。
Once the work is done, then we can merge the output.

5568
07:54:42,638 --> 07:54:44,246
最后一个是异步。
And the last one is async.

5569
07:54:45,040 --> 07:54:48,640
在这里，每个任务都由各个智能体独立执行。
Here, each task is executed independently by each agent.

5570
07:54:49,102 --> 07:54:51,120
这些就是 Crew AI 的工作流。
These are the crew AI workflows.

5571
07:54:51,360 --> 07:54:51,680
好的。
Okay.

5572
07:54:52,400 --> 07:54:56,452
让我们也了解一下这些所有工作流之间的区别。
Let's also understand the differences among all these workflows.

5573
07:54:57,198 --> 07:55:01,188
把这些看作是 AI 智能体团队协作的不同方式。
Think of these as different ways a team of AI agents can work together.

5574
07:55:01,774 --> 07:55:05,760
在串行流中，智能体一个接一个地工作。
In a sequential flow, agents work one after another.

5575
07:55:06,158 --> 07:55:11,364
第一个智能体完成任务后，将结果传递给下一个智能体，以此类推。
The first agent completes its task, then passes the result to the next agent, and so on.

5576
07:55:11,822 --> 07:55:17,860
例如，智能体 A 写一篇文章，完成后由智能体 B 进行编辑。
For example, agent A writes an article and once it's finished, agent B edits it.

5577
07:55:18,286 --> 07:55:26,148
在层级流中，有一个管理或领导智能体负责分配任务给其他智能体并协调它们的工作。
In a hierarchical flow, there is a manager or leader agent that assigns tasks to other agents and coordinates their work.

5578
07:55:26,720 --> 07:55:33,508
例如，一个管理智能体要求一个智能体进行调研，另一个智能体撰写报告。
For example, a manager agent asks one agent to do research and another agent to write a report.

5579
07:55:34,702 --> 07:55:38,660
而混合流结合了层级和串行两种方法。
And a hybrid flow combines both hierarchical and sequential approaches.

5580
07:55:39,150 --> 07:55:45,028
领导智能体将工作委派给多个智能体，他们的输出随后按顺序合并或审查。
A leader agent delegates work to multiple agents and their outputs are later combined or reviewed in sequence.

5581
07:55:45,440 --> 07:55:52,324
例如，一个领导者智能体将研究任务分配给两个智能体，然后由审核智能体来汇总并检查它们的结果。
For example, a leader assigns research to two agents and then a reviewer agent combines and checks their results.

5582
07:55:52,974 --> 07:55:57,476
在并行流中，多个智能体同时处理不同的任务。
In a parallel flow, multiple agents work at the same time on different tasks.

5583
07:55:57,902 --> 07:56:00,932
它们不需要等待彼此完成才开始工作。
They do not need to wait for each other to finish before starting.

5584
07:56:01,440 --> 07:56:06,756
例如，两个智能体同时独立研究不同的主题。
For example, two agents independently research different topics simultaneously.

5585
07:56:06,960 --> 07:56:14,960
在异步流中，智能体独立工作，不会在等待其他任务完成前才继续进行。
In an async flow, agents work independently and do not wait for other tasks to complete before continuing.

5586
07:56:15,406 --> 07:56:18,116
任务可以在准备就绪时随时开始、运行并完成。
Tasks can start, run and finish whenever they are ready.

5587
07:56:18,400 --> 07:56:24,880
例如，一个智能体在发送定期状态更新的同时，其他智能体仍在处理它们的任务。
For example, an agent sends periodic status updates while other agents are still working on their tasks.

5588
07:56:25,166 --> 07:56:26,720
这里有一个简单的类比。
Here is a simple analogy.

5589
07:56:27,214 --> 07:56:30,180
例如，考虑一个学校项目。
For example, consider a school project.

5590
07:56:30,830 --> 07:56:35,684
串行流可以是学生 A 写报告，然后学生 B 进行审核。
Sequential flow could be student A writes the report and then student B reviews it.

5591
07:56:36,046 --> 07:56:40,640
在层级流中，团队负责人给所有学生分配任务。
In hierarchical flow, the team leader assigns tasks to all students.

5592
07:56:40,942 --> 07:56:46,532
在混合流中，团队负责人分配任务，然后由另一个学生汇总所有人的工作。
In hybrid flow, team leader assigns tasks, then another student combines everyone's work.

5593
07:56:47,022 --> 07:56:51,972
并行流可以是所有学生同时处理不同的部分。
Parallel flow could be all students work on different sections at the same time.

5594
07:56:52,462 --> 07:56:58,756
最后是异步流，学生在完成自己的部分后立即提交，无需等待其他人。
And finally, async flow, students submit their parts whenever they finish without waiting for others.

5595
07:57:00,142 --> 07:57:07,396
所以当我们定义团队时，还需要说明我们希望智能体遵循的工作流类型。
So when we define the crew, we also need to mention the type of workflow which we want our agents to follow.

5596
07:57:07,790 --> 07:57:16,036
因此，把不同的智能体组合在一起就是智能体的编排，而定义工作流就是智能体的编排。
So putting different agents together is nothing but orchestrating the agents, and defining the workflow is nothing but the agents orchestration.

